Those questions were raised in proceedings between Mr Testa and Mr Lazzeri, supported by Banca Fideuram SpA (hereinafter
          Fideuram
          ), and Commissione Nazionale per le Società e la Borsa (hereinafter
          Consob
          ) concerning the removal of Mr Testa and the suspension of Mr Lazzeri from the professional register of financial promoters.
